    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slide, skate, and sled downhill on a wholesome and magical adventure with your forest friends as you restore springtime to a frozen world! You play as Finn, a critter who wakes up completely alone in a changed forest. Go on a journey with Finn to awaken friends, find community, and discover what\u2019s hidden beneath the snow.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awaken cute critters with unique and human personalities. Chat, frolic in the snow together, and they might sled alongside you down the mountain slopes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go down the mountain however you\u2019d like. Seamlessly switch between running, sliding, sledding, and skating using a dynamic movement system that flows with the terrain.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow an uplifting, playful narrative about friendship, embracing change, and finding balance in life with the help of others.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover an interactive winter wonderland built with Unreal Engine 5! Leave trails in the snow and watch as the frost melts before your eyes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619230/extras/165b537c9670aad3d0cc1a187b666f35.avif?t=1743443102\" width=128 height=128 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slide, skate, and sled downhill on a wholesome and magical adventure with your forest friends as you restore springtime to a frozen world! You play as Finn, a critter who wakes up completely alone in a changed forest. Go on a journey with Finn to awaken friends, find community, and discover what\u2019s hidden beneath the snow.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awaken cute critters with unique and human personalities. Chat, frolic in the snow together, and they might sled alongside you down the mountain slopes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go down the mountain however you\u2019d like. Seamlessly switch between running, sliding, sledding, and skating using a dynamic movement system that flows with the terrain.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow an uplifting, playful narrative about friendship, embracing change, and finding balance in life with the help of others.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover an interactive winter wonderland built with Unreal Engine 5! Leave trails in the snow and watch as the frost melts before your eyes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619230/extras/165b537c9670aad3d0cc1a187b666f35.avif?t=1743443102\" width=128 height=128 /></span></p>",
